stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Ready : xTaskCreate()

    Ready --> Running : taskSELECT_HIGHEST_PRIORITY_TASK() / PendSV Restore
    Running --> Ready : Preemption by Higher Priority Task / Round-Robin Time Slice
    Running --> Blocked : vTaskDelay() / vTaskDelayUntil()
    Blocked --> Ready : Tick Timeout (SysTick_Handler) / Event Signal

    Running --> Suspended : vTaskSuspend()
    Ready --> Suspended : vTaskSuspend()
    Blocked --> Suspended : vTaskSuspend()

    Suspended --> Ready : vTaskResume()
